<title>USA: FREE-T0-TRADE - Conn. Health and Ed, $33.6 mln.</title>
<headline>FREE-T0-TRADE - Conn. Health and Ed, $33.6 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>STATE OF CONNECTICUT HEALTH AND</p>
<p>EDUCATION FACILITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS, CONNECTICUT COLLEGE ISSUE</p>
<p>SERIES C</p>
<p>RE: $33,620,000</p>
<p>Effective at 12:00 Noon E.S.T., Monday, December 23, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
